[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m Then use tools in any order that makes sense:
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m ### 🧠 Reasoning Tool
