[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m ### 📋 Processing Tools
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m **`<filter>facts</filter>`**
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m - Filter by semantic relevance or temporal constraints
