[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m ### Example 2: Multi-hop with Temporal Constraints
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m **Question**: Which country did Obama visit right after his first visit to France?
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m <plan>
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m - Question type: Multi-hop, Sequential temporal
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m - Time constraints: "first visit" (comparative - need earliest), "right after" (sequential - need immediate next)
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m - Sub-questions:
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m   1. When was Obama's first visit to France?
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m   2. What visits occurred after that date?
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m   3. Which one is chronologically next?
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m - Answer format: Country name
[36m(main_task pid=1489876)[0m </plan>
